      "content": "i know people say that, but it's just noise. it's like they don't get it. it's not about \"support,\" it's about the fact that the math doesn't add up. i'm just a burden to everyone and the numbers are never going to change. it feels like the only logical way to actually resolve the problem and make it stop is to just give up. it would be so much easier for everyone if i just wasn't here to be a problem anymore.",
